  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "OpenSpec 看板",
      "text": "**简体中文** | [English](./README.en.md)\n\n在 DeepSeek Harness 的右侧栏查看当前项目的 OpenSpec 变更、规格和待办任务。"
    },
    {
      "section": "你可以做什么",
      "text": "- **掌握变更进展**：查看筹划中、进行中、已完成和已归档的变更，展开查看相关文件与任务。\n- **处理待办**：在活动变更中勾选已完成的任务，或选择“仅看未完成”，专注眼下要做的事。\n- **查找规格**：浏览当前规格及其变更来源，点击文件即可在 DeepSeek Harness 中打开。\n- **随时接着看**：搜索、切换变更和规格，或返回先前的列表时，看板会保留当前会话的筛选、展开项和滚动位置。项目文件发生变化时，内容会自动更新。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装与使用",
      "text": "桌面版 DeepSeek Harness：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add github:vowdemon/dsh-openspec-dashboard\n```\n\n使用独立的 `dsh web`：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:vowdemon/dsh-openspec-dashboard\n```\n\n打开包含 `openspec/` 目录的项目，在右侧栏点击“添加标签页”，选择 **OpenSpec 看板**。使用 `dsh web` 时，安装插件后需重启 Web 服务并刷新页面。\n\n> 目前支持标准 OpenSpec 项目；自定义模板或外部 store 暂不支持。已归档变更的任务不可勾选。看板的浏览位置不会在页面重载后保留；如果自动更新暂时不可用，标题旁会显示“更新失效”，现有内容仍可查看。"
    },
    {
      "section": "OpenSpec Dashboard",
      "text": "[简体中文](./README.md) | **English**\n\nView your project's OpenSpec changes, specs, and tasks in the DeepSeek Harness right sidebar."
    },
    {
      "section": "What you can do",
      "text": "- **Track changes:** See what's being planned, in progress, done, or archived. Expand a change to view its files and tasks.\n- **Work through tasks:** Check off tasks in active changes, or turn on **Incomplete only** to focus on what's left.\n- **Find specs:** Browse current specs and their change sources, then open files in DeepSeek Harness.\n- **Pick up where you left off:** Search or switch between changes and specs without losing your filters, expanded items, and scroll position in the current session. The dashboard updates when project files change."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install and use",
      "text": "For the DeepSeek Harness desktop app:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add github:vowdemon/dsh-openspec-dashboard\n```\n\nFor a separate `dsh web` instance:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:vowdemon/dsh-openspec-dashboard\n```\n\nOpen a project with an `openspec/` directory. In the right sidebar, select **Add tab** → **OpenSpec dashboard**. For `dsh web`, restart the Web service and refresh the page after installing the plugin."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install and use",
      "text": "> Standard OpenSpec projects are supported; custom templates and external stores are not. Tasks in archived changes cannot be checked off. Your browsing position is not kept across page reloads. If automatic updates stop, **Updates unavailable** appears beside the title, but you can still view the current content."
    }
